      <p><font size="5" face="Verdana"><i><font size="6">Words of Wisdom<br>
        <font size="2">Donated by the wise and sometimes irreverent members of 
        the Spirit of Fire, and their friends.</font></font></i></font></p>
  

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;We all walk in whispers through this life, whether through shadow and craft, theft and guile, or shattering sheild and splintering blow, weaving swordplay into song, bringing the divine to the world, and seeking clarity in a moment's revelation, or seekinf knowledge and power through sorcery's might. The trick is not to walk alone&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Aadyen Bogarden</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;live with intention. walk to the edge. listen hard practice wellness. play with abandon.laugh.choose with no regret. continue to learn. appreciate your friends. do what you love.  live as if this is all there is!!!!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Aaelaanya Bladewarder</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Look at me ma, I'm a tank!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Abai Dyngfaythe</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;&quot;Insanity in individuals is something rare - but in groups, parties, nations and epochs, it is the rule.&quot; -Nietzsche&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Aenamar Silverheart</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Don't ever stop dreaming because they can come true....&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Aianu Silverheart</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;I rock so much I shoulda been made of stone...&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Ascalhorn Bladewarder</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Sigh ...he was alive when i left.&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Bhhaal </font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;There is no gravity, the earth just suxx&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Bimm </font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;oops I fizzled again, but I'll heal you my friend, casting baby one more time&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Britknee Sphears</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Did I pull that??&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Charisi </font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;It's only a flesh wound.&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Cordain Nytewolf</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;I'm huge, and the babes go wild!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Cuisenorc </font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;The only problem you will ever experience in life is not getting your own way&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Daishan </font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Iam invincible, iam great, i can do everything, LOADING, PLEASE WAIT -Daramar&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Daramar Arcanefist</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;WOOT! You go girl =)&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Delementia Skyfox</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Schau ma mal&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Depp Lutebasher</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Waryon ya feelin cold?&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Dianah Runningwolf</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Death is simple, Living is the hard part&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Dragius Shadowbringer</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;/e stuffs Sanadan into the Naughty Guildee Sack again&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Duerana Stormfyre</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;I am jacks complete lack of surprise&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Duluvian DreadSoul</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;BLOOD FOR THE BLOOD GOD!!!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Eaven Reaverofsouls</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;To nuke or not to nuke that is the question that plagues the wizard in all of us&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Epicurus Protostar</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Wheeeeee! Im a tank!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Euenyil Eveningtide</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Work like you don't need the money.....Love like you've never been hurt....Dance like no one is watching....&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Falelinax </font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;If you think being a cleric is boring, well then, maybe you're not doing it right.&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Falqour Thornwalker</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;The most harm can result from the best intentions.&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Fuergrissa OstDrauka</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Let my army be the rocks and the trees and the birds in the sky (Charlemagne)&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Genra Flickerfox</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Every human life is a spark in the darkness. It flares for a moment, catches the eye, and is gone forver. A retinal after-image that fades and is obscured forever by newer, brighter lights. When the last light goes dim will we be alone in the dark, or will the after-glow blur in to one and form a new life to re-start it all?&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Goalan Overmind</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;"I will never betray my goon dock friends, We will stick together until the whole world ends, Through heaven and hell, and nuclear war, Good pals like us, will stick like tar, In the city, or the country, or the forest, or the boonies, I am proudly declared a fellow Goonie"&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Gooniee Forrever</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Play DAoC.&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Grayshadow </font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;remember that those who never die play under their level !&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Gregprax Arcanum</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;"Ah, He's only part dead." Just call me Miracle Hal.&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Haletma Glimtrepe</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Don't make me smack you with my geetar!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Hexum </font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Where would you be if today wasn't here?&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Horen Knight</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Men are ruled either by desire and emotion or reason and knowledge - Plato&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Ibidaar </font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Poison? You call that poison? I'LL GIVE YOU POISON!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Ikthog Blizzardborn</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;I am the Amazing Incredible Tanking Mage&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Jaduis Innconnu</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;"Yeah I'm a Skittle! Lime/grape at that! Why ya gotta problem with that? "&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Jasber Stumpworthy</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;I Came, I Saw, I Nuked It To Ashes&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Kaeladil Dal'Thaine</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;"If at first you don't succeed, screw it and get a hobby"&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Kaizel Mezzaire</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Ther are no strangers in this life, just friends not yet known or enemies not yet made!!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Kanamorm Dreamwalker</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;All religions, all this singing, one song.  The differences are just illusion and vanity.&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Kantor Klezmer</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;It's not a train until I kill the guild leader&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Kayel </font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;You dont know the POWAH of the Dark Side!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Kirrov Blacksoul</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;one more blue&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Kreelak Biskaine</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Hush now. No more tears. 'Tis a waste of such good suffering. (Pinhead)&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Lacandor Vomica</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Who are you?...What do you want?...Why are you here?...Do you have anything worth living for?&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Lanamor Fyrehart</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Walking up the mountain wearies you less than a stone in your boot. Small things can conquer large ones&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Loagn Lighteweilder</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;All good things will come to an end... memories do not&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Lucane Darkseraphim</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;My pants cast clarity, do yours?&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Magiq Phaze</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Hey big guy, can ya spare some MANA plz? :)&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Manaseeker Thousandfaces</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Grant me the wisdom to change things that I can, the patience to accept the things I cannot, andthe strength to hide te bodies of those that pissed me off!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- McGilla Gutspilla</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;I did not come to force my way, my strength is in the words I say. Let man bow down and God repay. &quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Mckenna Stormangel</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;buzzz&quot;</i></font><br>
