    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;We live for the one, we die for the one!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Monel Lyghtfyre</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;IT'S NOT A DRESS!&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Moonwolf Fyrespirits</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;"A Druid is answerable solely to the Voice of his own conscience!"  &quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Morlyn Pendraigon</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Fraggle, it's what's for dinner.&quot;</i></font><br>
