    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Well, I didn't want Charisi to be the only guy in the guild with a female toon...&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Naryea Brazenpyre</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Come to the darkside!!!&quot;</i></font><br>
