        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Neckrom Anamakon</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;Fear kiting is the bomb.&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Novus Suvon</font></b></p>

    <p><font face="Times New Roman"><i>&quot;MBYFO?&quot;</i></font><br>
        <b><font face="Verdana" size="2">- Odom </font></b></p>

